## Phase 3: AI Outfit Engine (Sprint 3)

### Sprint 3.1: Outfit Generation Core

- [ ] 3.1.1 Implement outfit generation algorithm
  - Create `src/services/outfitEngine.ts`
  - Filter wardrobe items by clean status and availability
  - Generate candidate combinations
  - _Requirements: 12_

- [ ] 3.1.2 Create compatibility scoring system
  - Implement formality alignment scoring
  - Implement weather suitability scoring
  - Implement color harmony indicators
  - _Requirements: 13, 14_

- [ ] 3.1.3 Implement recent wear tracking
  - Track last worn date per item
  - Calculate days since last worn
  - Apply penalty for recently-worn items
  - _Requirements: 18_

- [ ] 3.1.4 Create AI-enhanced outfit synthesis
  - Send promising candidates to Gemini for explanations
  - Generate editorial-style descriptions
  - _Requirements: 15_

- [ ] 3.1.5 Write unit tests for scoring algorithms
  - Test formality scoring with various inputs
  - Test weather scoring with different conditions
  - _Requirements: 13, 14_

- [ ]* 3.1.6 Write property test for outfit diversity
  - **Property 1: Outfit Diversity**
  - **Validates: Requirements 12.2**
  - Test that multiple distinct outfits are generated

### Sprint 3.2: Context-Aware Outfit Generation

- [ ] 3.2.1 Implement context parsing
  - Parse context from user request
  - Extract temperature, occasion, mood, time of day
  - Validate context fields
  - _Requirements: 12_

- [ ] 3.2.2 Implement weather data integration
  - Create `src/services/weatherService.ts`
  - Fetch weather from OpenWeatherMap API
  - Cache weather data (15-minute TTL)
  - _Requirements: 14, 22_

- [ ] 3.2.3 Create weather-aware outfit filtering
  - Filter items by seasonality
  - Adjust recommendations based on temperature
  - Recommend appropriate layers for cold weather
  - _Requirements: 14_

- [ ] 3.2.4 Implement occasion-based filtering
  - Filter items by formality level
  - Ensure work-appropriate items for work occasions
  - _Requirements: 13, 14_

- [ ] 3.2.5 Write unit tests for context-aware generation
  - Test different weather scenarios
  - Test occasion matching
  - _Requirements: 14, 22_

### Sprint 3.3: Outfit Management

- [ ] 3.3.1 Implement saved outfits data model
  - Create TypeScript interfaces for `SavedOutfit`
  - Include item IDs, title, metadata, ratings
  - _Requirements: 16_

- [ ] 3.3.2 Implement outfit saving and retrieval
  - `POST /api/save-outfit` endpoint
  - `GET /api/saved-outfits` endpoint
  - `DELETE /api/saved-outfits/:id` endpoint
  - _Requirements: 16_

- [ ] 3.3.3 Implement outfit rating system
  - `POST /api/rate-outfit` endpoint
  - Track ratings per outfit
  - Update average ratings
  - _Requirements: 17_

- [ ] 3.3.4 Create outfit history tracking
  - Record wear events with timestamps
  - Track occasions and feedback
  - Calculate wear statistics
  - _Requirements: 18_

- [ ] 3.3.5 Write unit tests for outfit management
  - Test save, retrieve, delete operations
  - Test rating updates
  - _Requirements: 16, 17, 18_

- [ ]* 3.3.6 Write integration tests for outfit endpoints
  - Test full outfit workflow
  - _Requirements: 16, 17, 18_

