## Phase 4: Personal Stylist Features (Sprint 4)

### Sprint 4.1: Style Profile Learning

- [ ] 4.1.1 Implement style profile data model
  - Create `UserProfile` interface
  - Include preferences: favorite colors, avoided colors, formality range
  - Track learned patterns: frequently worn, frequently rejected
  - _Requirements: 19_

- [ ] 4.1.2 Implement preference-based filtering
  - Boost items matching favorite colors
  - Down-rank avoided items
  - Prioritize preferred brands
  - _Requirements: 12, 19_

- [ ] 4.1.3 Create learning feedback system
  - Adjust item scores based on ratings
  - Reduce frequency of rejected categories
  - Track learning progress indicator
  - _Requirements: 19_

- [ ] 4.1.4 Write unit tests for learning system
  - Test preference updates
  - Test scoring adjustments
  - _Requirements: 19_

### Sprint 4.2: Daily AURA Recommendation

- [ ] 4.2.1 Implement daily recommendation algorithm
  - Generate today's look based on context
  - Check weather from previous day
  - Suggest alternatives for repetition
  - _Requirements: 21_

- [ ] 4.2.2 Create daily outfit display component
  - Show weather conditions and temperature
  - Display recommended outfit
  - Show explanation and item details
  - _Requirements: 21_

- [ ] 4.2.3 Implement days-since-worn tracking
  - Calculate days since last worn per item
  - Display "You haven't worn these in X days"
  - _Requirements: 18, 21_

- [ ] 4.2.4 Write unit tests for daily recommendations
  - Test weather adjustment logic
  - Test repetition avoidance
  - _Requirements: 21_

### Sprint 4.3: Natural Language Interaction

- [ ] 4.3.1 Implement NLP request parsing
  - Create intent detection system
  - Extract context from user requests
  - Handle ambiguous requests
  - _Requirements: 20_

- [ ] 4.3.2 Create chat interface component
  - Message history display
  - Input area for natural language
  - Loading states for AI processing
  - _Requirements: 20_

- [ ] 4.3.3 Implement contextual assistance
  - Auto-include relevant wardrobe items
  - Ask clarifying questions when needed
  - _Requirements: 20_

- [ ] 4.3.4 Write unit tests for NLP parsing
  - Test intent detection
  - Test context extraction
  - _Requirements: 20_

