## Phase 5: Shopping Intelligence (Sprint 5)

### Sprint 5.1: Shopping Analysis Core

- [ ] 5.1.1 Implement shopping item data model
  - Create `ShoppingItem` interface
  - Include price, estimated value, upload timestamp
  - Link to AI-detected metadata
  - _Requirements: 23, 24_

- [ ] 5.1.2 Implement duplicate detection algorithm
  - Compare category, color, pattern, brand, silhouette
  - Calculate similarity scores
  - Categorize as NONE/LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH
  - _Requirements: 24_

- [ ] 5.1.3 Create outfit unlock calculation
  - Estimate minimum/maximum new outfits
  - Calculate based on existing wardrobe gaps
  - Provide supporting reasoning
  - _Requirements: 25_

- [ ] 5.1.4 Implement price validation
  - Compare against market estimates
  - Calculate fair price range
  - Flag significant overpricing (>20%)
  - _Requirements: 27_

- [ ] 5.1.5 Write unit tests for shopping analysis
  - Test duplicate detection with various inputs
  - Test price validation scenarios
  - _Requirements: 24, 25, 27_

### Sprint 5.2: Buying Recommendation System

- [ ] 5.2.1 Implement verdict generation
  - Create BUY/SKIP/CONSIDER logic
  - Include reasoning for each verdict
  - Calculate cost-per-wear estimate
  - _Requirements: 26_

- [ ] 5.2.2 Create shopping analysis UI component
  - Display AI-detected metadata
  - Show duplicate risk level
  - Present verdict with reasoning
  - _Requirements: 26_

- [ ] 5.2.3 Implement shopping history tracking
  - Save analysis results with timestamps
  - Link to outfit unlocks
  - Track purchase decisions
  - _Requirements: 26_

- [ ] 5.2.4 Write unit tests for recommendation system
  - Test verdict generation logic
  - Test reasoning generation
  - _Requirements: 26_

- [ ]* 5.2.5 Write integration tests for shopping endpoints
  - Test complete shopping analysis flow
  - _Requirements: 23, 24, 25, 26, 27_

