- [ ] 6.1.3 Implement weather integration for trips
  - Fetch weather for trip destination and dates
  - Store forecast data with trip
  - Adjust recommendations based on forecast
  - _Requirements: 22, 29, 30_

- [ ] 6.1.4 Write unit tests for trip management
  - Test CRUD operations
  - Test weather integration
  - _Requirements: 28, 29, 30_

### Sprint 6.2: Packing Recommendations

- [ ] 6.2.1 Implement packing algorithm
  - Match wardrobe items to trip requirements
  - Calculate outfit count per day
  - Identify missing items
  - _Requirements: 29, 30_

- [ ] 6.2.2 Create packing list UI component
  - Display daily outfit plan with previews
  - Show packing checklist
  - Indicate missing items
  - _Requirements: 29, 30_

- [ ] 6.2.3 Implement variety tracking
  - Ensure different outfits across days
  - Avoid repetition in trip packing
  - _Requirements: 30_

- [ ] 6.2.4 Write unit tests for packing recommendations
  - Test outfit matching logic
  - Test variety enforcement
  - _Requirements: 29, 30_

