- [ ] 7.1.5 Write visual regression tests for mobile
  - Test layouts on 320px, 375px, 414px widths
  - Test touch targets
  - _Requirements: 31, 32_

### Sprint 7.2: Production Readiness

- [ ] 7.2.1 Implement offline support
  - Queue pending actions
  - Sync when online
  - Conflict resolution strategy
  - _Requirements: 37_

- [ ] 7.2.2 Create onboarding flow
  - Welcome screen
  - First-item tutorial
  - Outfit generation demo
  - Skip option
  - _Requirements: 38_

- [ ] 7.2.3 Implement analytics dashboard
  - Wardrobe statistics (total items, value, utilization)
  - Category breakdown charts
  - Most/least worn items
  - _Requirements: 40_

- [ ] 7.2.4 Implement data export functionality
  - Export all data as JSON
  - Include all items, outfits, history
  - _Requirements: 39_

- [ ] 7.2.5 Write unit tests for analytics
  - Test statistics calculations
  - Test export functionality
  - _Requirements: 39, 40_

