## Phase 8: Security & Polish (Sprint 8)

### Sprint 8.1: API Security

- [ ] 8.1.1 Implement authentication middleware
  - Verify session tokens
  - Extract user ID from token
  - Add to request context
  - _Requirements: 33_

- [ ] 8.1.2 Implement rate limiting
  - Configure rate limit per IP
  - Return 429 status when exceeded
  - _Requirements: 33_

- [ ] 8.1.3 Implement input validation
  - Validate all input schemas
  - Sanitize string inputs
  - _Requirements: 35_

- [ ] 8.1.4 Write security tests
  - Test authentication bypass prevention
  - Test input validation
  - _Requirements: 33, 34, 35_

### Sprint 8.2: Testing & Documentation

- [ ] 8.2.1 Write end-to-end tests
  - Complete user flows
  - Mobile responsive tests
  - Authentication flows
  - _Requirements: All_

- [ ] 8.2.2 Create API documentation
  - Document all endpoints
  - Include request/response examples
  - _Requirements: All_

- [ ] 8.2.3 Create developer onboarding guide
  - Setup instructions
  - Architecture overview
  - Testing guide
  - _Requirements: All_

- [ ] 8.2.4 Performance testing
  - Verify response time SLAs
  - Test concurrent user handling
  - _Requirements: 36_

