## Checkpoints

- [ ] Checkpoint 1: Ensure Phase 1 foundation is complete
  - Wardrobe CRUD operations working
  - AI image analysis functional
  - Basic outfit generation working
  - Ask the user if questions arise.

- [ ] Checkpoint 2: Ensure Phase 2 features are complete
  - Shopping intelligence fully implemented
  - Style learning system working
  - Daily AURA recommendations functional
  - Ask the user if questions arise.

- [ ] Checkpoint 3: Ensure Phase 3 features are complete
  - Travel mode fully functional
  - Mobile responsive across all breakpoints
  - Onboarding flow complete
  - Ask the user if questions arise.

- [ ] Checkpoint 4: Ensure all tests pass and documentation is complete
  - Unit test coverage > 80%
  - Integration tests for all major flows
  - API documentation complete
  - Ask the user if questions arise.

---

## Notes

- Tasks marked with `*` are optional and can be skipped for faster MVP
- Each task references specific requirements for traceability
- Checkpoints ensure incremental validation
- Unit tests validate specific scenarios and edge cases
- Integration tests validate end-to-end workflows
- **MVP Scope (Sprints 1-3):** Focus on Requirements 1-27 (Authentication through Shopping Intelligence)

